#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:12
msgid "Transitions: VTOL/FW"
msgstr "切换：VTOL/固定翼"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:12
msgid "Assisted Fixed Wing Flight"
msgstr "固定翼辅助飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:12
msgid "Return to Launch"
msgstr "返回起飞点"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:5 1eac2feafad0491caffa12b7adc79bff
msgid "Flying a QuadPlane"
msgstr "飞行 QuadPlane"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:7 a5036c8d35544183a16d6d60a956c97a
msgid ""
"While flying a QuadPlane can actually be easier than flying a conventional "
"fixed wing aircraft there are some things you need to understand. Please "
"read the following sections carefully."
msgstr "虽然飞行 QuadPlane 实际上可能比驾驶传统固定翼飞机更容易，但有些事项需要了解。请仔细阅读以下各节内容。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:20 bf191de959364dca8e6f8249ac58c872
msgid "VTOL vs Fixed-Wing Level Trim"
msgstr "VTOL 与固定翼水平配平"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:22 ee5a32910f944dff8c8726504c9bc103
msgid ""
"Often fixed wing \"level\" trim, which is the pitch attitude stabilization "
"modes attempt to maintain, is set to be several degrees positive with "
"respect to the wing chord line in order to provide lift while cruising. See "
":ref:`common-accelerometer-calibration` and :ref:`tuning-cruise` for more "
"details."
msgstr ""
"固定翼「水平」配平是俯仰姿态稳定模式尝试维持的状态，通常相对于机翼弦线设置为正几度，以便在巡航时提供升力。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-"
"accelerometer-calibration` 和 :ref:`tuning-cruise`。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:24 43d5968b5ba641638fce0bcb5e078930
msgid ""
"However, when in VTOL modes, this can result in the vehicle leaning "
"\"backward\" a few degrees, building in a tendency to drift backwards. This "
"can be eliminated by setting the :ref:`Q_TRIM_PITCH<Q_TRIM_PITCH>` parameter"
" to correct this. This can also be used to correct minor CG imbalances "
"caused by VTOL motor placement not being exactly balanced around the CG."
msgstr ""
"然而，在 VTOL 模式下，这可能导致飞行器向后倾斜几度，产生向后漂移的趋势。可通过设置 "
":ref:`Q_TRIM_PITCH<Q_TRIM_PITCH>` 参数来消除此影响。该参数也可用于纠正因 VTOL "
"电机安装位置不完全在重心周围平衡而引起的轻微重心偏移。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:27 19aec56df11244198633b05b17f69ddd
msgid "Manual Forward Throttle in VTOL Modes"
msgstr "在 VTOL 模式下手动控制前向油门"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:29 e4b3d73d866f405aba6f314afab9fce2
msgid ""
"By setting an RC channel option (``RCx_OPTION``) to \"209\", that channel "
"can provide a separate throttle input to the forward motor(s) in QSTABILIZE,"
" QACRO, and QHOVER VTOL modes. This allows forward movement without having "
"to tilt the QuadPlane forward requiring throttle stick repositioning in "
"QSTABILIZE and QACRO to maintain altitude, and present more forward flat "
"plate resistance to forward movement in all modes. The maximum percentage "
"throttle that will be applied by this channel is set by "
":ref:`Q_FWD_MANTHR_MAX<Q_FWD_MANTHR_MAX>`."
msgstr ""
"通过将 RC 通道选项（``RCx_OPTION``）设为「209」，该通道可在 QSTABILIZE、QACRO 和 QHOVER VTOL "
"模式下为前向电机提供独立的油门输入。这样无需向前倾斜 QuadPlane 即可向前移动，在 QSTABILIZE 和 QACRO "
"模式中无需重新调整油门摇杆位置以维持高度，同时在所有模式中减少向前的正面阻力。该通道施加的最大油门百分比由 "
":ref:`Q_FWD_MANTHR_MAX<Q_FWD_MANTHR_MAX>` 设定。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:34 594707788c954be09ca9284a866345ac
msgid "Radio or Throttle Failsafe"
msgstr "遥控或油门失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:36 ce551a28f0004d9f964fb14eebeaadfd
msgid ""
"If flying in a plane mode or AUTO, behaviour is determined by the "
":ref:`FS_SHORT_ACTN<FS_SHORT_ACTN>` and :ref:`FS_LONG_ACTN<FS_LONG_ACTN>` "
"parameter settings (see Plane Failsafe Function). QuadPlanes can be set such"
" that instead of normal plane behaviour on Failsafe induced RTLs, to "
"transition to QRTL and land once at the rally point or home, if  "
":ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` =1. If :ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` =2, then "
"a fixed wing approach followed by a loiter to alt and QRTL will be executed,"
" similar to that described in the \"AUTO VTOL Landing\" section of "
":ref:`quadplane-auto-mode`."
msgstr ""
"在固定翼模式或 AUTO 模式下飞行时，行为由 :ref:`FS_SHORT_ACTN<FS_SHORT_ACTN>` 和 "
":ref:`FS_LONG_ACTN<FS_LONG_ACTN>` 参数设置决定（参见 Plane 失控保护功能）。如果 "
":ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` =1，QuadPlane 可设置为在失控保护触发 RTL 时切换到 QRTL 并在集结点或 "
"Home 点着陆，而非执行普通飞机行为。如果 :ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` =2，则将执行固定翼进近后盘旋降高，再执行 "
"QRTL，类似于 :ref:`quadplane-auto-mode` 中「AUTO VTOL 降落」部分的描述。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:38 95f192b60c8d4212adb30ecbe18bd840
msgid ""
"If flying in any VTOL mode (QHOVER,QSTAB,etc.) and not flying a mission, "
"failsafe will evoke QLAND , QRTL or RTL, depending on how "
":ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>`, bits 5 and 20, are set."
msgstr ""
"在任何 VTOL 模式（QHOVER、QSTAB 等）下飞行且未执行任务时，失控保护将触发 QLAND、QRTL 或 RTL，具体取决于 "
":ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 第5位和第20位的设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:40 94a50d33eb164fb49b2f0887fadf0830
msgid ""
"if failsafe occurs during a VTOL takeoff, it will immediately switch to "
"QLAND mode"
msgstr "如果在 VTOL 起飞过程中发生失控保护，将立即切换到 QLAND 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:43 cbb8bd7d10334d0d82c882d7b9eb7734
msgid "VTOL Landing Repositioning"
msgstr "VTOL 降落重定位"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:45 2f51faf7cce94c1abb8a87d6a41f8a27
msgid ""
"During the final descent phase of QRTL/QLAND or a mission VTOL LAND command,"
" repositioning the vehicle or pausing the descent is usually not possible "
"unless switching to a pilot controlled mode like QLOITER. However, there are"
" two options that can be enabled to give the pilot control:"
msgstr ""
"在 QRTL/QLAND 或任务 VTOL LAND 命令的最终下降阶段，通常无法重新定位飞行器或暂停下降，除非切换到飞手控制的模式（如 "
"QLOITER）。但有两个选项可以启用以赋予飞手控制权："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:48 41f1e4164dd94e778aa3fcc5ee4b7375
msgid "Throttle Descent Control"
msgstr "油门下降控制"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:50 dd4858ac917c49b7bac3570c7b8eb419
msgid ""
"If :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 15(+32768 to param value), is set, it "
"will allow pilot to control descent during VTOL AUTO-LAND phases, similar to"
" throttle stick action during QHOVER or QLOITER. However, this will not "
"become active until the throttle stick is raised above 70% momentarily "
"during the descent at least once."
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 第15位（参数值+32768）被设置，它将允许飞手在 VTOL AUTO-LAND "
"阶段控制下降速度，类似于 QHOVER 或 QLOITER 中的油门摇杆操作。但是，在下降过程中，油门摇杆至少需要被推过70%一次后，此功能才会激活。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:53 deba75c62f864e228cb19eb4bfe2886a
msgid "Horizontal Repositioning"
msgstr "水平重定位"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:55 39d2b9d8078b4b4b9524f487b83b4eb8
msgid ""
"If :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 17(+131072 to param value), is set, it "
"will enable pilot horizontal re-positioning during VTOL auto LAND phases "
"using the pitch and roll sticks like QLOITER, momentarily pausing the "
"descent while doing so."
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 第17位（参数值+131072）被设置，在 VTOL "
"自动降落阶段，飞手可以使用俯仰和横滚摇杆进行水平重定位（类似 QLOITER），操作期间下降将暂时暂停。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:60 96cb75af3a9f4e94ad791d94d0a4f17c
msgid "What Will Happen?"
msgstr "会发生什么？"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:62 5a4117a67e334d0e802d8f818492b3d0
msgid ""
"Understanding hybrid aircraft can be difficult at first, so below are some "
"scenarios and how the ArduPilot code will handle them."
msgstr "理解混合飞行器起初可能比较困难，以下是一些场景及 ArduPilot 代码的处理方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:66 f104893eb4074198be6c0584fb97c270
msgid "I am hovering in QHOVER/QLOITER and switch to FBWA mode"
msgstr "我在 QHOVER/QLOITER 中悬停，然后切换到 FBWA 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:68 de015bb78e804fd184db50400d85af29
msgid ""
"The aircraft will continue to hover, setting forward thrust/throttle at "
"whatever the throttle stick position dictates and gaining speed. If you zero"
" throttle during the transition, the aircraft will continue to hold the "
"current height and hold itself level, slowing to a halt. It will drift with "
"the wind as it is not doing position hold."
msgstr ""
"飞机将继续悬停，根据油门摇杆位置设定前向推力/油门，并逐渐加速。如果在切换过程中将油门降至零，飞机将继续保持当前高度并保持水平，最终减速停止。由于没有位置保持，它会随风漂移。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:71 8d0c837937c5491f88b064af0a233c7d
msgid ""
"If you advance the throttle stick then the forward motor will throttle-up "
"and the aircraft will start to move forward. The quad motors will continue "
"to provide both lift and stability while the aircraft is moving slowly. You "
"can control the attitude of the aircraft with roll and pitch stick input. "
"When you use the pitch stick (elevator) that will affect the climb rate of "
"the quad motors. If you pull back on the elevator the quad motors will "
"assist with the aircraft climb. If you push forward on the pitch stick the "
"power to the quad motors will decrease and the aircraft will descend."
msgstr ""
"如果推进油门摇杆，前向电机将增加油门，飞机将开始向前移动。在飞机缓慢移动时，四旋翼电机将继续提供升力和稳定性。您可以用横滚和俯仰摇杆输入控制飞机姿态。使用俯仰摇杆（升降舵）时，将影响四旋翼电机的爬升率。向后拉升降舵，四旋翼电机将辅助飞机爬升；向前推俯仰摇杆，四旋翼电机功率将降低，飞机将下降。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:81 07f866d3cd1d465bb11995ea1775d4ae
msgid ""
"The roll and pitch input also controls the attitude of the aircraft, so a "
"right roll at low speed will cause the aircraft to move to the right. It "
"will also cause the aircraft to yaw to the right (as the QuadPlane code "
"interprets right aileron in fixed wing mode as a commanded turn)."
msgstr ""
"横滚和俯仰输入也控制飞机的姿态，因此在低速时右滚将导致飞机向右移动，同时也会导致飞机向右偏航（因为 QuadPlane "
"代码将固定翼模式下的右副翼输入解释为指令转弯）。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:86 288696c97cc14e92a3b7e6f70a53561d
msgid ""
"Once the aircraft reaches an airspeed of :ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN <AIRSPEED_MIN>` "
"(or :ref:`Q_ASSIST_SPEED <Q_ASSIST_SPEED>` if that is set and is greater "
"than :ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN <AIRSPEED_MIN>`) the amount of assistance the quad "
"motors provide will decrease over 5 seconds. After that time the aircraft "
"will be flying purely as a fixed wing."
msgstr ""
"一旦飞机达到 :ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN <AIRSPEED_MIN>`（或 :ref:`Q_ASSIST_SPEED "
"<Q_ASSIST_SPEED>`，如果已设置且大于 :ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN "
"<AIRSPEED_MIN>`）的空速，四旋翼电机的辅助量将在5秒内逐渐降低，之后飞机将完全以固定翼方式飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:92 0d1ea0ecbccf42a7beb9e005d70f113e
msgid "I am flying fast in FBWA mode and switch to QHOVER mode"
msgstr "我在 FBWA 模式下快速飞行，然后切换到 QHOVER 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:94 6ccbf920f65043b1bef07b4747cfe19a
msgid ""
"The quad motors will immediately engage and will start by holding the "
"aircraft at the current height. The climb/descent rate is now set by the "
"throttle stick, with a higher throttle stick meaning climb and a lower "
"throttle stick meaning descend. At mid-stick the aircraft will hold "
"altitude."
msgstr ""
"四旋翼电机将立即启动，首先保持飞机在当前高度。爬升/下降速率现在由油门摇杆控制，油门摇杆越高表示爬升，越低表示下降。摇杆处于中位时，飞机将保持高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:100 9be7a4726bfd483683270e2c18f8f87d
msgid ""
"The forward motor will stop, but the aircraft will continue to move forward "
"due to its momentum. The drag of the air will slowly bring it to a stop. The"
" attitude of the aircraft can be controlled with roll and pitch sticks "
"(aileron and elevator). You can yaw the aircraft with rudder."
msgstr ""
"前向电机将停止，但由于惯性，飞机将继续向前运动。空气阻力将使其缓慢停止。可以用横滚和俯仰摇杆（副翼和升降舵）控制飞机姿态，用方向舵控制偏航。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:107 09b06315d10f41e2b32ee1f9a16f1a45
msgid "I switch to RTL mode while hovering"
msgstr "我在悬停中切换到 RTL 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:109 461e4b3421ef4ff6982b4072a3afe7df
msgid ""
"The aircraft will generally transition to fixed wing flight. The quad motors"
" will provide assistance with lift and attitude while the forward motor "
"starts to pull the aircraft forward. Depending on the "
":ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>`, different behaviors can be selected as it "
"returns to the return point (rally or home). See :ref:`quadplane_rtl` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"飞机通常会切换到固定翼飞行。四旋翼电机将在前向电机开始牵引飞机向前移动时提供升力和姿态辅助。根据 "
":ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` 的不同，返回途中可以选择不同的行为。详见 :ref:`quadplane_rtl`。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:115 524b0ca28d84482db9092c9afeeb59da
msgid ""
"If you have :ref:`RTL_AUTOLAND <RTL_AUTOLAND>` setup then the aircraft will "
"follow the mission configuration."
msgstr "如果您已设置 :ref:`RTL_AUTOLAND <RTL_AUTOLAND>`，飞机将按照任务配置执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:120 85e5dddc41534b5d950d01a383c389d6
msgid "I switch into QRTL close to HOME"
msgstr "我在靠近 Home 时切换到 QRTL"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:122 3c595948df4f4822bdca42400f3913ea
msgid ""
"If closer than 1.5X the larger of either :ref:`RTL_RADIUS<RTL_RADIUS>` or "
":ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD<RTL_RADIUS>`, then the vehicle will proceed toward home "
"in VTOL mode and land. If greater, it will transition to fixed wing, "
"climbing toward :ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE<RTL_ALTITUDE>` and executing a normal "
"QRTL. Depending on how far from home, the vehicle may only briefly climb and"
" then switch back to approach or airbrake phases. The further away, the "
"higher the climb as it flies back toward home. If the approach behavior has "
"ben disabled with :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 16, then it will just "
"switch to VTOL (if not already in that mode, navigate to home and land)."
msgstr ""
"如果距离不超过 :ref:`RTL_RADIUS<RTL_RADIUS>` 或 :ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD<RTL_RADIUS>` "
"中较大值的1.5倍，飞行器将在 VTOL 模式下飞向 Home 并降落。如果距离更远，将切换到固定翼，爬升至 "
":ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE<RTL_ALTITUDE>` 并执行正常 QRTL。根据距 Home "
"的远近，飞行器可能只是短暂爬升然后切换回进近或气动制动阶段。距离越远，在飞回 Home 途中爬升越高。如果已通过 "
":ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 第16位禁用进近行为，则将直接切换到 VTOL（如果尚未处于该模式），导航至 Home 并降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:125 9df7ac5651f94936991e8b9b9cd723c2
msgid "I have an EKF Failsafe"
msgstr "我发生了 EKF 失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:127 6320e489bb424ab59593bba10e03be82
msgid ""
"ArduPilot provides a failsafe mechanism to protect VTOL operation in case "
"the EKF becomes unhealthy. In normal fixed wing operation, ArduPilot \"falls"
" back\" to another inertial guidance filter, DCM, if the EKF becomes "
"unhealthy. However, if operating in AUTO mode in a VTOL mode when an EKF "
"failure occurs, QuadPlanes will switch modes to QLAND, and to QHOVER in all "
"other position control VTOL modes (QLOITER, QRTL, QLAND, QAUTOTUNE)."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 提供了一种失控保护机制，以保护 EKF 不健康时的 VTOL 操作。在普通固定翼操作中，如果 EKF 不健康，ArduPilot "
"会「回退」到另一个惯性制导滤波器 DCM。然而，如果在 AUTO 模式以 VTOL 模式运行时发生 EKF 故障，QuadPlane 将切换到 "
"QLAND 模式；在其他所有位置控制 VTOL 模式（QLOITER、QRTL、QLAND、QAUTOTUNE）下，将切换到 QHOVER。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:130 fa2c19ca09b14547816f7aa7c5554111
msgid "Typical Flight"
msgstr "典型飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:132 b78b42d6a1c7441b8b0a5f9a22bc522a
msgid "A typical test flight would be:"
msgstr "典型的测试飞行流程如下："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:134 29b763d44ec4403e91dbceee031f6df5
msgid ""
"VTOL takeoff in :ref:`QLOITER<qloiter-mode>` or :ref:`QHOVER<qhover-mode>`"
msgstr ""
"在 :ref:`QLOITER<qloiter-mode>` 或 :ref:`QHOVER<qhover-mode>` 中进行 VTOL 起飞。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:135 040ea877c8e94a959c4ee10d68268081
msgid ""
"switch to :ref:`FBWA <fbwa-mode>` mode and advance throttle over 50% and "
"start flying fixed wing"
msgstr "切换到 :ref:`FBWA <fbwa-mode>` 模式，将油门推过50%，开始固定翼飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flying.rst:137 2e23b0bb21354484a7fc8bbf2669807e
#, python-format
msgid ""
"switch to :ref:`QHOVER<qhover-mode>` mode to go back to quad mode and reduce"
" throttle back to 50% for hover."
msgstr "切换到 :ref:`QHOVER<qhover-mode>` 模式回到四旋翼模式，将油门降回50%进行悬停。"
